From: Linux BR
Subject: [PATCH] KPropertiesDialog: apply pending changes without closing

Reuse the asynchronous native apply sequence and refresh its editing baseline.
Prevent concurrent application and discard callbacks from a failed attempt.

--- a/src/widgets/kpropertiesdialog.h
+++ b/src/widgets/kpropertiesdialog.h
